  [ [=[<LoreItalics>Derketo's softer rites ended at the altar's edge. Beyond silk, perfume, and whispered vows waited the instruments of her harsher devotion: blades for opening desire, hooks for teaching obedience, and killing strokes delivered with a lover's patience.</>

This pair of daggers is a sacred weapon carried by the faithful of Derketo.

<LoreItalics>Ecstatic Duet: Your attacks apply Temptation for 8 seconds, stacking up to 12 times. Temptation deals 2 Astral damage per stack each second. If any of your active followers are humans of the opposite sex, their attacks consume up to 4 Temptation stacks to deal 5 Astral damage per stack, heal for double that amount, and grant you Indulgence for 8 seconds. Your attacks consume Indulgence to deal 20 bonus Astral damage and restore 40 stamina. Becoming exhausted consumes Indulgence.</>

<LoreItalics>Astral magic damage sometimes causes a delayed explosion, damaging enemies in an area and granting you an absorb shield based on damage done.</>

<LoreItalics>Adaptive weapons use your higher weapon damage attribute, Strength or Agility, and benefit from the matching bonus weapon damage stat on your armor.</>]=] ] = [=[<LoreItalics>Мягкие обряды Деркето кончались у края алтаря. За шёлком, благовониями и шёпотом клятв ждали орудия её сурового культа: клинки, что вскрывают желание, крюки, что учат покорности, и смертельные удары, нанесённые с терпением любовника.</>

