(These values can be adjusted by Admins in the Admin settings)

This is the EAA Fame menu.
When you press "Increase Fame",
you will get a Fame Potion. 
On use you will be reset to Level 5,
but you will recive a "Fame Letter" as Reward.

With this Letter, you go to the "Legendary Vendor"

There you can purchase a "Star of the habit" for that Letter.

With that "Star" you can buy items in the Fameshop.

Make sure you have the Feat in the Religion-Tab, called
"Star of the habit".

If you dont see the Feat there, your admins have blocked it.

A "Increase Fame" is available if you have Level X, by default 60

Happy Level-Hunt!]=] ] = [=[Зелье можно выпить с уровня X
